            "notes": "## Powers\n\nEarly game, you don\u2019t have many HP items yet for [Lifelift](item_641c3e2b-d652-4dc6-9ab9-1e5307b78325), so [Containment Shield](item_0406217c-a6af-4a19-8c7d-052c4d402848) is usually better. It makes the game easier because it lets you push and disengage faster.  \n\n## Items\n\n[Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf), [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0), and [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) are pretty standard and provide the highest possible damage output.",
