            "notes": "## Items\n\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) is our core damage item. [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) is arguably the best item in the game for its price\u2014movement speed is especially valuable on Zarya. Keep the green items if possible.  \n\nAgainst armor or shields (blue HP \u2014 **not** barriers), you can swap [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) for [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66).  \n\n[Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f), [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) and [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8) are solid choices if you have extra cash.",
