            "notes": "## Powers\n\nBy R3\u2013R5, we start picking up more HP items, so [Lifelift](item_641c3e2b-d652-4dc6-9ab9-1e5307b78325) becomes much more useful.  \n\n## Items\n\n[Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) is the best item for Zarya \u2014 practically made for her. It gives roughly 20% more damage and 25 armor, which also improves your bubble.  \n\nAgainst armor, you can take [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27). It increases damage by 15% versus armor, since armor reduces beam damage by a flat 30%. Pick this into heroes like Orisa, Rein, or D.Va, but only if your goal is to focus the enemy tank \u2014 which isn\u2019t always the right play.  \n\nIf you had a poor round, go for [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) and green HP items.  \n\n[Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) is also a solid pickup if you have extra money \u2014 it gives 5% more attack speed and extra ammo, which becomes very important as you start burning through ammo quickly.  \n\n## IMPORTANT\n\n[Blastproof Boots](item_530190fc-db36-481e-9bd7-4a0a05c5e53d) is an insane item. I highly recommend buying it if you can afford it. It\u2019s great versus mobile comps or heroes like Rein who can\u2019t easily reach you when you jump. It gives access to high ground and better escape options. If you ever have spare money, replace one of the green items with this. At any point in the game, if you can afford it, swap in [Blastproof Boots](item_530190fc-db36-481e-9bd7-4a0a05c5e53d) \u2014 it even lets you access the enemy backline.  \n\n## Counterpick Items (covered here only)\n\n- [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) VS debuffs like Ashe or Ana  \n- [Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) VS headshot-focused heroes like Cass, Soldier, Reaper, Zen, and others  \n- [Stratosphere Beacon](item_15bf2dc7-5161-47b0-929b-17cbb1d54182) VS D.Va, Genji, Juno, and Mercy \u2014 basically heroes that spend a lot of time in the air",
