            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Barrier Benefits](item_755f31ec-feac-4c68-9a47-fe24f6a9c6af) is useful because enemies often try to shoot you after the bubble expires. There are some alternative options as well below.\n\n[Volskaya Vortex](item_4a24240a-a0b1-4a0e-83d1-acf8c5647b5b) shines against stationary comps. It still slows enemies even if you don\u2019t have AP for it to deal significant damage.  \n\n[Pre\u2011Workout](item_cdfbf8ce-d7cc-4b31-9c59-8b65fcb7b158) pairs well with [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643), giving you 25% lifesteal at high charge.  \n\n## Items\n\nThis round, you\u2019re deciding between increasing damage or getting survivability.  \n\n- For damage, take [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b). In poorer rounds, you can run [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) and rare items like [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1).  \n- For defense, take [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c), which effectively gives 20% damage reduction on the current patch.  \n\nIf you have extra credits, swap out [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) for either [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) or [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) to increase damage.",
