            "created_at": "2025-09-20T03:40:39.646376+00:00",
            "notes": "## Items\n\nThis round, you should get a defensive item unless you are far ahead or not under pressure. [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) improves your bubble and provides a 20% damage reduction. Alternatively, [R\u00fcstung von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4) is very powerful and makes your bubbles extremely tanky. Lastly, [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) is strong if you have trouble getting kills with [Graviton Surge](ability_ee77e90e-37bb-4d27-ad68-d8a370ce9c17). You charge ult fairly fast.\n\nIf you\u2019re ahead, consider [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643). [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) excels in sustained-composition fights, helping you outlast opponents with continuous beam damage.  \n\n[Bigger Beam](item_c29f5350-77e0-4bbb-a775-09bac9b10688) offers greater reach, letting you hit evasive targets like Juno, Mercy, Genji, or Freya, though I rarely pick this item.  \n\nIf you have extra cash, replace [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) with [Blastproof Boots](item_530190fc-db36-481e-9bd7-4a0a05c5e53d), [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054), or [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2).",
