            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-20T03:40:39.646376+00:00",
            "notes": "## Powers\n\nThe remaining powers are not very important, so you can pick what you like for the most part.\n\n[Pre-Workout](item_cdfbf8ce-d7cc-4b31-9c59-8b65fcb7b158) gives some lifesteal.\n\n[Volskaya Vortex](item_4a24240a-a0b1-4a0e-83d1-acf8c5647b5b) is mainly useful for the slow rather than the damage.\n\n## Items\n\nThere are several options in the last round, and you\u2019ll need to decide what works best. I recommend picking one survival item and the rest damage items. For most rounds, that\u2019s [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) or [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121).\n\n[Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) can be extremely powerful late game because of the high damage and HP it provides. This pairs well with [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) to reach 20% CDR without losing much damage while the item is active. You can still Grav once per round, mostly at the end.  \n\n[Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) provides cheap AP and improves bubbles by 25% at 5 stacks, which you can get quickly from a bit of left-clicking. It also gives 25 HP and makes Vortex slightly stronger.  \n\n[Bigger Beam](item_c29f5350-77e0-4bbb-a775-09bac9b10688) is a win-more item due to its high cost. Only buy if ahead and facing mobile heroes that are hard to reach.  \n\n[Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) is strong against flying heroes and synergizes with [Bigger Beam](item_c29f5350-77e0-4bbb-a775-09bac9b10688). The HP and attack speed it provides are also valuable.  \n\n[Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) can replace [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) if you have enough money, as it also gives 25 HP. The effect is not important.",
